      "description": "The drawing room at Blair Castle. The Drawing Room ceiling is one of the finest in Scotland. The furniture includes Louis XVI gilt chairs and settees by Chipchase with embroidered covers by the 3rd Duchess and her family. The Bulloch cabinets are made from estate larch.",
